# baresip account for the Judicom.  Copy to /home/joe/.baresip/accounts and put the password of the "judicom-auth" section of
# judicom.conf on the NAS in place of CHANGE_ME.  Put the NAS's Tailscale address (tailscale ip -4 on the NAS) in place of NAS_TAILSCALE_ADDRESS.  The real file is not kept in git.
<sip:judicom@NAS_TAILSCALE_ADDRESS:5060;transport=udp>;auth_user=judicom;auth_pass=CHANGE_ME;regint=60
